        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>复数练习题</title>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = {\n  tex: {\n    inlineMath: [['$', '$'], ['\\\\(', '\\\\)']],\n    displayMath: [['$$', '$$'], ['\\\\[', '\\\\]']]\n  }\n};\n</script>\n<script id=\"MathJax-script\" async src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n<style>\n  @page {\n    size: A4;\n    margin: 15mm;\n  }\n  * {\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n  }\n  body {\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 30px;\n    background-color: #f7f9fa;\n    background-image: \n      linear-gradient(to right, rgba(0, 150, 255, 0.05) 1px, transparent 1px),\n      linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(0, 150, 255, 0.05) 1px, transparent 1px);\n    background-size: 20px 20px;\n    font-family: \"SimSun\", \"STSong\", \"Songti SC\", \"Times New Roman\", serif;\n    color: #111;\n    line-height: 1.6;\n  }\n  .page-container {\n    max-width: 800px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    background: transparent;\n  }\n  \n  /* Question Styles */\n  .question-block {\n    margin-bottom: 35px;\n    position: relative;\n  }\n  .question-title {\n    font-size: 15px;\n    font-weight: normal;\n    margin-bottom: 12px;\n    line-height: 1.6;\n  }\n  .answer-blank {\n    color: #d9232e;\n    font-family: \"Comic Sans MS\", \"KaiTi\", cursive, sans-serif;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    font-size: 18px;\n    padding: 0 4px;\n    display: inline-block;\n  }\n  .options-row {\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    margin-bottom: 15px;\n    font-size: 15px;\n  }\n  .option-item {\n    flex: 1;\n  }\n\n  /* Handwritten Notes Styles */\n  .handwriting {\n    font-family: \"KaiTi\", \"STKaiti\", \"Biaodian Pro Sans CNS\", cursive, sans-serif;\n    font-size: 14px;\n    line-height: 1.7;\n  }\n  .hw-blue {\n    color: #0d5cb6;\n  }\n  .hw-red {\n    color: #d9232e;\n  }\n  \n  /* Layout for Problem 1 */\n  .p1-solution-wrap {\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    align-items: center;\n    margin-top: 5px;\n    padding-left: 200px;\n    position: relative;\n  }\n  .watermark-tilt {\n    position: absolute;\n    left: 140px;\n    top: 30px;\n    transform: rotate(-65deg);\n    font-size: 11px;\n    color: #8fa3b7;\n    letter-spacing: 2px;\n    font-family: sans-serif;\n  }\n  .p1-text-solution {\n    flex: 1;\n  }\n  .p1-diagram {\n    width: 140px;\n    margin-left: 15px;\n  }\n\n  /* Layout for Problem 2 */\n  .p2-solution-wrap {\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    align-items: center;\n    margin-top: 5px;\n    text-align: left;\n  }\n  .p2-content {\n    display: inline-block;\n  }\n  .red-box {\n    border: 1.5px solid #d9232e;\n    padding: 1px 6px;\n    display: inline-block;\n    margin: 2px 0;\n  }\n\n  /* Layout for Problem 3 */\n  .p3-solution-wrap {\n    margin-top: 10px;\n    padding-left: 210px;\n  }\n  .annotated-box {\n    position: relative;\n    display: inline-block;\n  }\n  .box-label {\n    position: absolute;\n    top: -24px;\n    left: 50%;\n    transform: translateX(-50%);\n    font-size: 12px;\n    white-space: nowrap;\n    text-align: center;\n    line-height: 1;\n  }\n  .inner-box {\n    border: 1.5px solid #d9232e;\n    padding: 0 2px;\n    display: inline-block;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n<div class=\"page-container\">\n\n  <!-- Problem 1 -->\n  <div class=\"question-block\">\n    <div class=\"question-title\">\n      $A, B$ 分别是复数 $z_1, z_2$ 在复平面内对应的点, $O$ 是原点, 若 $|z_1 + z_2| = |z_1 - z_2|$, 则三角形 $AOB$ 一定是 ( <span class=\"answer-blank\">B</span> ) .\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"options-row\">\n      <div class=\"option-item\">A. 等腰三角形</div>\n      <div class=\"option-item\">B. 直角三角形</div>\n      <div class=\"option-item\">C. 等边三角形</div>\n      <div class=\"option-item\">D. 等腰直角三角形</div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Handwritten Solution & Diagram -->\n    <div class=\"p1-solution-wrap handwriting hw-blue\">\n      <div class=\"watermark-tilt\">21教育</div>\n      <div class=\"p1-text-solution\">\n        <div>由复数的几何意义得</div>\n        <div style=\"padding-left: 1.5em;\">$\\vec{OA}, \\vec{OB}$ 表示 $z_1, z_2$</div>\n        <div>$\\because |z_1 + z_2| = |z_1 - z_2|$</div>\n        <div>$\\therefore$ 由平面向量加减法得</div>\n        <div style=\"padding-left: 1.5em;\">以 $\\vec{OA}, \\vec{OB}$ 为邻边所作的平行四边形的对角线相等</div>\n        <div>$\\therefore$ 此平行四边形为矩形</div>\n        <div>$\\therefore \\triangle AOB$ 为直角三角形</div>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- Vector Diagram -->\n      <div class=\"p1-diagram\">\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 130 80\" width=\"130\" height=\"80\" style=\"overflow: visible;\">\n          <defs>\n            <marker id=\"arrow-blue\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"6\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"6\" markerHeight=\"6\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\">\n              <path d=\"M 0 1.5 L 8 5 L 0 8.5 z\" fill=\"#0d5cb6\"/>\n            </marker>\n            <marker id=\"arrow-red\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"6\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"6\" markerHeight=\"6\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\">\n              <path d=\"M 0 1.5 L 8 5 L 0 8.5 z\" fill=\"#d9232e\"/>\n            </marker>\n          </defs>\n          <!-- Parallelogram outline -->\n          <line x1=\"20\" y1=\"55\" x2=\"20\" y2=\"20\" stroke=\"#0d5cb6\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" marker-end=\"url(#arrow-blue)\" />\n          <line x1=\"20\" y1=\"55\" x2=\"105\" y2=\"55\" stroke=\"#0d5cb6\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" marker-end=\"url(#arrow-blue)\" />\n          <line x1=\"20\" y1=\"20\" x2=\"105\" y2=\"20\" stroke=\"#d9232e\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-dasharray=\"3,3\" />\n          <line x1=\"105\" y1=\"55\" x2=\"105\" y2=\"20\" stroke=\"#d9232e\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-dasharray=\"3,3\" />\n          \n          <!-- Diagonals -->\n          <line x1=\"20\" y1=\"55\" x2=\"105\" y2=\"20\" stroke=\"#d9232e\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" marker-end=\"url(#arrow-red)\" />\n          <line x1=\"20\" y1=\"20\" x2=\"105\" y2=\"55\" stroke=\"#d9232e\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" marker-end=\"url(#arrow-red)\" />\n          \n          <!-- Labels -->\n          <text x=\"10\" y=\"22\" fill=\"#0d5cb6\" font-size=\"11\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">A</text>\n          <text x=\"10\" y=\"60\" fill=\"#0d5cb6\" font-size=\"11\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">O</text>\n          <text x=\"110\" y=\"62\" fill=\"#0d5cb6\" font-size=\"11\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">B</text>\n          \n          <text x=\"23\" y=\"38\" fill=\"#0d5cb6\" font-size=\"8\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">$\\vec{OA}-\\vec{OB}$</text>\n          <text x=\"80\" y=\"36\" fill=\"#0d5cb6\" font-size=\"8\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">$\\vec{OA}+\\vec{OB}$</text>\n        </svg>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- Problem 2 -->\n  <div class=\"question-block\">\n    <div class=\"question-title\">\n      已知 $\\mathrm{i}$ 为虚数单位, 则 $\\mathrm{i} + \\mathrm{i}^2 + \\mathrm{i}^3 + \\cdots + \\mathrm{i}^{2019}$ 等于 ( <span class=\"answer-blank\">D</span> ) .\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"options-row\">\n      <div class=\"option-item\">A. $\\mathrm{i}$</div>\n      <div class=\"option-item\">B. $1$</div>\n      <div class=\"option-item\">C. $-\\mathrm{i}$</div>\n      <div class=\"option-item\">D. $-1$</div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Handwritten Solution -->\n    <div class=\"p2-solution-wrap handwriting\">\n      <div class=\"p2-content\">\n        <div class=\"hw-blue\">$\\mathrm{i} + \\mathrm{i}^2 + \\mathrm{i}^3 + \\cdots + \\mathrm{i}^{2019}$</div>\n        <div class=\"hw-blue\">$= \\mathrm{i} + \\mathrm{i}^2 + \\mathrm{i}^3 + \\cdots + \\mathrm{i}^{504 \\times 4 + 3}$</div>\n        <div>\n          <span class=\"red-box hw-blue\">$\\mathrm{i}^{4n} + \\mathrm{i}^{4n+1} + \\mathrm{i}^{4n+2} + \\mathrm{i}^{4n+3} = 0$</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"hw-red\" style=\"font-size: 13px; margin: 2px 0;\">周期为4, 周期内和为0</div>\n        <div class=\"hw-blue\">$\\therefore$ 原式 $= \\mathrm{i} + \\mathrm{i}^2 + \\mathrm{i}^3$</div>\n        <div class=\"hw-blue\" style=\"padding-left: 2.2em;\">$= -1$</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- Problem 3 -->\n  <div class=\"question-block\">\n    <div class=\"question-title\">\n      若复数 $z$ 满足 $(3 - 4\\mathrm{i})z = |4 + 3\\mathrm{i}|$, 则 $\\bar{z}$ 的虚部为 ( <span class=\"answer-blank\">B</span> ) .\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"options-row\">\n      <div class=\"option-item\">A. $-4$</div>\n      <div class=\"option-item\">B. $-\\dfrac{4}{5}$</div>\n      <div class=\"option-item\">C. $-4\\mathrm{i}$</div>\n      <div class=\"option-item\">D. $-\\dfrac{4}{5}\\mathrm{i}$</div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Handwritten Solution -->\n    <div class=\"p3-solution-wrap handwriting\">\n      <div class=\"hw-blue\">\n        $\\because (3 - 4\\mathrm{i})z = |4 + 3\\mathrm{i}|$\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"hw-blue\" style=\"margin: 4px 0;\">\n        $\\therefore z = \\dfrac{|4 + 3\\mathrm{i}|}{3 - 4\\mathrm{i}} = \\dfrac{5}{3 - 4\\mathrm{i}}$ \n        <span class=\"hw-red\" style=\"font-size: 13px; margin-left: 5px;\">$\\rightarrow$ 先求出 $z$</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"hw-blue\" style=\"margin: 4px 0; padding-left: 3.5em;\">\n        $= \\dfrac{5(3 + 4\\mathrm{i})}{(3 - 4\\mathrm{i})(3 + 4\\mathrm{i})}$ \n        <span class=\"hw-red\" style=\"font-size: 13px; margin-left: 5px; display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle;\">\n          $\\rightarrow$ 分母、分子同时乘 $3-4\\mathrm{i}$<br><span style=\"padding-left: 1.2em;\">的共轭复数</span>\n        </span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"hw-blue\" style=\"margin: 4px 0; padding-left: 3.5em;\">\n        $= \\dfrac{3}{5} + \\dfrac{4}{5}\\mathrm{i}$\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"hw-blue\" style=\"margin-top: 15px;\">\n        $\\therefore \\bar{z} = \\dfrac{3}{5}$ \n        <span class=\"annotated-box\">\n          <span class=\"box-label hw-red\">虚部<br>↓</span>\n          <span class=\"inner-box hw-blue\" style=\"color: #0d5cb6;\">$-\\dfrac{4}{5}$</span>\n        </span>\n        $\\mathrm{i}$\n        <span style=\"margin-left: 15px;\">$\\therefore \\bar{z}$ 的虚部为 $-\\dfrac{4}{5}$</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n</div>\n\n</body>\n</html>"
